    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβολ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>groom who helps one to mount,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>CG</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stirrup,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1406.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lever, instrument for lifting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.11.26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.88
			</span></i>.</div>
